| GT | YOLO26m-Seg | YOLO11m-Seg | YOLOv8m-Seg |
|---|---|---|---|
| 2001 | FN; best IoU 0.265 | FN; best IoU 0.265 | FN; best IoU 0.259 |
| 2002 | FN; best IoU 0.009 | FN; best IoU 0.010 | FN; best IoU 0.009 |
